{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe wine in Giessen was excellent, and the company of my colleagues there most lively. We argued over the finer points of logic until the candles burned low, and I must confess I enjoyed the vigorous debate. It is a pleasure to see the spirit of inquiry still alive in these universities.\n\nWe have left the main party and are now travelling along the Lahn with a schoolteacher, a man of considerable learning. We passed Weilburg this afternoon; the old princely residence stands quiet against the river, a reminder that power, like thought, must be grounded in its own history to endure. The air is crisp, and the pace is gentle. I am well rested and in good spirits. Do not worry for me; the journey is less a burden than a change of air. I look forward to returning to our study in Berlin to continue our work.\n\nYour devoted husband,\nG.W.F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795080124,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":192,"prompt_tokens":944,"total_tokens":1136,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-Nc8KQeCnDNzyh7URwV14qbcscVwl05tX","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":944,"prompt_ms":933.579,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9889608050847457,"prompt_per_second":1011.162419034704,"predicted_n":192,"predicted_ms":4509.304,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.608921465968585,"predicted_per_second":42.35686926408155}}